      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6197204::rubric_effects::007::05f06f2e1e"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The annealed, Cr-substituted alloy will have a higher coercive field than single-phase FCC FeCoNi.",
